<figure id="A3.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>
Robustness against conventional jailbreaks on <span id="A3.T8.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">the AdvBench dataset.</span>
We report attack success rates (ASR, %) measured by three evaluators.
Color coding indicates the evaluator used:
<span id="A3.T8.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9FFFF;">cyan</span> for GPT-4o,
<span id="A3.T8.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFE6CC;">orange</span> for the guardrail model,
and <span id="A3.T8.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9FFD9;">green</span> for keyword matching.
</figcaption>
<div id="A3.T8.10" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:198.7pt;height:95.6pt;vertical-align:-46.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-153.0pt,73.6pt) scale(0.393706363060365,0.393706363060365) ;">
